    writing: ["Write a 50–75 word email explaining why you missed a meeting update. Describe what had happened before you saw the message, apologise appropriately, and propose a way to avoid repetition.", "Write a 175–225 word essay evaluating notification-free periods at work. Distinguish routine communication from urgent situations and address one objection to your recommendation."],
