    writing: ["Write a 50–75 word email to a student-support office. Explain a barrier you experienced, ask whether its waiting-time figures include your appointment type, and request a practical next step.", "Write a 175–225 word essay evaluating the use of averages to judge public services. Explain a benefit, a risk, and a more balanced reporting approach."],
