    writing: ["Write a 50–75 word email to a museum. Identify a label that could be misunderstood, suggest a clearer wording, and ask which source was used to write it.", "Write a 175–225 word essay evaluating whether public museums should prioritise simple narratives or transparent accounts of historical uncertainty. Propose a way to balance both."],
